name tikz-mirror-lens
category Package
revision 65500
shortdesc Spherical mirrors and lenses in TikZ
relocated 1
longdesc This package allows the automatic drawing of the image of
longdesc objects in spherical mirrors and lenses from the data of the
longdesc focus, from the position and height of the object. It
longdesc calculates the position and height of the image, and also
longdesc displays the notable rays.
runfiles size=6
